---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy — CA Mayank Wadhera" description="How camayankwadhera.com handles visitor information." current="privacy">
<section class="hero page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mega">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:28px">
      <p>Last updated: 19 November 2026.</p>
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>This site does not set cookies, does not run analytics and does not store anything you type into it. The company that hosts the site keeps standard server logs of page requests, as every web host does.</p>
      <h2>The enquiry form</h2>
      <p>The enquiry form does not send anything by itself. It opens your own email app with a message filled in, and nothing leaves your device until you choose to send that email.</p>
      <h2>Emails you send</h2>
      <p>If you email an enquiry, the details in it are used to reply to you and may be passed to the venture best placed to help, such as CA4CPA, Legal Suvidha, MKW Advisors, DigiComply, CorpReady or GrowBiz. They are not sold or used for unrelated marketing.</p>
      <h2>Questions and deletion</h2>
      <p>To ask what is held about you, or to have your enquiry deleted, write to <a href="mailto:camayankwadhera@gmail.com">camayankwadhera@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
